[{"comment_id": "7675714209205224249", "create_time": 1787141480, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "村里人：不能去的\n南翔：", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "61486", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAujNFRoc3HA2Cd53Io_REeQrltumLuP5tzO-5t1sZlvU", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAujNFRoc3HA2Cd53Io_REeQrltumLuP5tzO-5t1sZlvU", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "45441756512", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "𝘀𝗶𝗻𝗰𝗲𝗿𝗲", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_608bd41468bec05161d4fdc5e367dc55.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "156", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675311185998955283", "create_time": 1787047646, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "跟哥们儿说实话吧，你和九月到底要干啥！修仙带我啊[流泪]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "35928", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA6np-nS5iz1_XOWpWNn0_xKlJBG2w-u4CTKF6iHbJJm0", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA6np-nS5iz1_XOWpWNn0_xKlJBG2w-u4CTKF6iHbJJm0", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "688586161", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "观风听雪", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_okYEyzwQfAEVFICjABe0wGERxiEeiAAw1mAIs2.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "95", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675349233649615653", "create_time": 1787056503, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "或许巫伶儿本就知道根本不存在所谓的情蛊，但是她带着南翔把一个个毒虫装进罐子，她又怎么可能不知道虫子相互残杀根本就不会有幸存。就算存活了，虫子又怎么会操控人的心呢？所谓的蛊不过是人类为了赋予未知危险具体化的人格而自编的假想敌。正所谓，世上本无事，庸人自扰之。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "4969", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAkCq_zp587aJeZUqXowxwtX_saMqJIvKX8Z43f2UyYC0", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAkCq_zp587aJeZUqXowxwtX_saMqJIvKX8Z43f2UyYC0", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "38766983222", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "huang", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_e0f27d77e22d3ba8fe7c2c0f083ca5f2.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "57", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675327041486455589", "create_time": 1787051336, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "这种有深度的视频真的很少见了，终于了解到这独一份的民俗。我听到“蛊在苗疆叫做蛊”的时候真的鸡皮疙瘩都起来了。\n\n在别的地方呢，它可以是一切能承载或是被迫承载人们对天灾人祸的仇恨与不愿面对苦难的懦弱的容器，可是器物太易碎，动植物又听不懂人们的话语，狠毒的字句落在他们身上才像落在棉花上，怨天地，天聋地哑太遥远，仇恨在距离限制上被无限缩小，只有人，最容易被推上神坛后弑神再到娱神。\n“蛊女”的故事真的很令人动容。", "is_author_digged": true, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "19142", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAM2Yq3Vn4EEcgoSMuPNDj6sHQPIrUdIrJCgkgmthJJtG5HOeLV1ZZcCXmwM1wb0_u", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAM2Yq3Vn4EEcgoSMuPNDj6sHQPIrUdIrJCgkgmthJJtG5HOeLV1ZZcCXmwM1wb0_u", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "850203081014_22", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "Ivy", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_owEXCA7BEJAf2IDPATAgZSyjOFFNQ4nDe0Slke.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "58", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7689719204160914235", "create_time": 1790402272, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "别怀疑，巫蛊之术这玩意真的有，虽然现在大部分失传了，还有的是现在苗族女娃不学了，只是没人给你下而已，厉害的巫蛊之术，都是老一辈的苗族圣女才会，也不是随便教，教就能会的", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "253", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAS6F7OFTWGYtLosymE5fc6hnSAqKf9rjBLKb5PO53Vik", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAS6F7OFTWGYtLosymE5fc6hnSAqKf9rjBLKb5PO53Vik", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1118500722", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "一生只为一人02", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_a224a9fafae3a3a958e8f09822f72b89.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "6", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675744275950371633", "create_time": 1787148481, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "下蛊其实是一件很科学的事情，在一个坛子里面养99种蛊虫，留下最后一只活着的毒王，大部分其实都是针对外出的男人来下的情蛊。把毒虫磨成粉末加进食物就是一种慢性毒药，以前没有解药，只能过一段时间回来找妻子，缓解慢性毒药", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "92", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAF6AKpQRSW5s4z_ajrknPkKvelVUFMqn3C8rb64XaNbbMTRrIsK3rJ7fh1zh1OXvU", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAF6AKpQRSW5s4z_ajrknPkKvelVUFMqn3C8rb64XaNbbMTRrIsK3rJ7fh1zh1OXvU", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "65461359125", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "잔광의 끝길°💤", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_osC9Biw4E4qASAAHIClAcoiATp1oSEfU7LA3he.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "5", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675312612477403939", "create_time": 1787047977, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "我们那边学蛊，下蛊是一个人人喊打的存在 ，以前我们那边下蛊挺多的，我小时候就被过蛊，都会带一个铜的手镯防下蛊，如果是陌生人碰到你了，回来之后你就觉得头昏脑胀，不舒服的可能就是会下蛊了，我们就会请解蛊婆来解蛊。其实蛊有很多种，慢性蛊，急性蛊都有。养蛊对自身伤害也挺大的", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "569", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA4nwfHnzvWoyA_a6e5RXFOdL0OfZ_6LpQbK4WGzsXDiRTBDeaLvMsbUkGsApiNKmn", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA4nwfHnzvWoyA_a6e5RXFOdL0OfZ_6LpQbK4WGzsXDiRTBDeaLvMsbUkGsApiNKmn", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "33777153842", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "邱豆麻袋", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oofpXh9AALDCvWFEEmF3hIAeAcATQgCt0HACMA.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "40", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675719818766811962", "create_time": 1787142786, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "有个事情我要说下，一些苗族老人是不能拍照的苗寨里面一些地方也是不能拍照的，不然是对他们的不敬。有的老人会认为照相会对他们不好等等，被说会下蛊的那个老奶奶出来满眼是戒备。去之前应该先了解一下当地风俗习惯还有一些忌讳的。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "237", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAN3HfAebDDshI8nufgg_XelDiFy9sCs_3bMwhOmU4OUkQdfG_UwV-h3NHBnbSlFeC", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAN3HfAebDDshI8nufgg_XelDiFy9sCs_3bMwhOmU4OUkQdfG_UwV-h3NHBnbSlFeC", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "30417382369", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "箐鸽鸽鸽鸽鸽鸽", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oERAuf0nJwc9DXAIAceEAXCoREZFEwisqWUaAB.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "9", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7676102801198383921", "create_time": 1787231957, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "不要解密，蛊术流传很久，有一定的价值，神秘感让人产生敬畏之心，解决信任问题，看破不说破方为大善。有了信任度的加持吃药效果才好，现在很多病看不好是病人不相信医生，没有信任再好的药也没用，所以老中医讲不信者不医就是这个道理。我是做中医养生的，也修道医，20多年前年就解决了心中的困惑，所以不说破给病人一线生机为善。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "219", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAwi7o3vPZzLOZgXuSW3yV__-KSp7GK0_OU17Eu2YdNeI", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAwi7o3vPZzLOZgXuSW3yV__-KSp7GK0_OU17Eu2YdNeI", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "885948946", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "资笛箫社养生馆", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/mosaic-legacy_7e750013e9ed7b21c60a.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "4", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675569342751507259", "create_time": 1787107752, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "个人见解：蛊就是有些用看不见的细菌或者虫卵放置他们一般不会注意的饮食小细节里面，等虫卵细菌成长后再发作，身体感到不适，这称为下蛊，情蛊或许就是下蛊的虫子，有些虫子分公虫和母虫，一般不刻意在乎的话不会有事，如果距离隔得远或者折磨虫子，可能会使另外一方的虫感到难受，导致身体感到不适，因为湘西湿热地带雨林气候导致各种各类的虫子比较多。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "231", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAABoZEuKTjcQmAt3l1WIjISuxa8fNIrl5yepiw-TUh0YI", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAABoZEuKTjcQmAt3l1WIjISuxa8fNIrl5yepiw-TUh0YI", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "87050766", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "北风吹", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_o8AJYlAiABunDAaEAA3v1I8yvciAP0l4huQJM.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "12", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675518307206152986", "create_time": 1787095870, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "作为湘西本地人 我的确也中过蛊 那感觉生不如死 走亲戚的还好好的 突然在门口看见一个老婆婆对我邪魅的眼神笑了笑 我不太在意 然后凌晨三点左右我痛的生不如死  本人没有什么突发疾病的 去了医院都检查不出 之后也是找专门去蛊的人给我弄一下就好了", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "1272", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAzNgbtommEPuAgTvjJ8g55o9LyTrCnPksA-qmJ8yUh8BGjWDs5gOTnd0N1c8sTaeZ", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAzNgbtommEPuAgTvjJ8g55o9LyTrCnPksA-qmJ8yUh8BGjWDs5gOTnd0N1c8sTaeZ", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "guomei20", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "一只蝈蝈✨", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_8af5af53552190a97fb027aa6efc6c03.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "78", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675552621345030927", "create_time": 1787103860, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "我是苗族人 我外婆说 我小时候中过不是很烈的蛊 也不是情蛊 可能就是一种毒虫 当时我嘴唇肿了 我外婆就拿刚煮好的鸡蛋 剥了壳 在我嘴唇外面滚 然后那个鸡蛋光滑的表面上就出现了很多黑色的洞 密密麻麻的", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "631", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAACU-3meK22AL3_xtHc02QhuNnWfpwGW9YCO3-lQAkrJ0", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAACU-3meK22AL3_xtHc02QhuNnWfpwGW9YCO3-lQAkrJ0", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "RiiOuO_0115", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "困困鲨鱼🦈💤", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_ee23528ba19c3a7c18f7a97bfbbac456.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "24", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675348209447322426", "create_time": 1787056264, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "现在126w了你们看的时候多少了", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "358", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAqvFm6PgheGvtBJQ_NA7DRjx-6HD4S7XPlvwg2eCR-Us", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAqvFm6PgheGvtBJQ_NA7DRjx-6HD4S7XPlvwg2eCR-Us", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "47491362370", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "ikeu", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oAqDEUfAADEyawAAQLnCfFJ5yEotcIio9C1kAA.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "91", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675569686088631094", "create_time": 1787108304, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "以下是我的亲身经历：我是湘西苗族的，关于苗蛊我们村上也没有这类传说，所以对于苗蛊我基本就是信其有不信其神，但是我清楚的记得我小时候有一次被吓到了，后面就肚子痛，受不了了就跟我家人说，我没说我被吓到的事，他们开始也问了是不是吃坏东西了之类的，我说没有，当时忘了谁来了一句有没有被吓到，我说了有，然后就讨论了起来，说什么去找谁来给我叫魂（被吓到丢魂了，要叫魂才能叫回来），后面我爸就出去找了一个老婆婆来了，老婆婆说拿五根（好像是这么多）稻草（我们都会留着，基本村里每家都有）来，后面就让我把衣服掀起露出肚子，在我肚子上从上到下的刮过嘴里还念叨着，刮一下给稻草缠一下，刮了五六下就找了根棍子绑在上面插在外面，没过多久就好了（据说是野鬼在肚子里闹腾，被稻草给缠出来了，放外面等他自己脱困了会走）", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "352", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA5zGZyAKKuXdJ0nkS36LLwi0quMAn7A1XbkcuFbO8R3c", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA5zGZyAKKuXdJ0nkS36LLwi0quMAn7A1XbkcuFbO8R3c", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1055719209", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "能看见の风", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_o4YAdAiI2EBWf4AAJ9Agf9iMniI99vIADAnlUC.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "14", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675312025404703538", "create_time": 1787047840, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "现在8.5万了你们看到的时候多少万了？", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "22569", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA_1ZkCkrf9gR0wSCArsDyNsFGuSGMhFFyuvEaBDqlbmc", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA_1ZkCkrf9gR0wSCArsDyNsFGuSGMhFFyuvEaBDqlbmc", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "61700919787", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "cure.", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_oMEpF9CprezVrioHziDBdgAACDAfAoVA7IA8ia.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "2503", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675335465746826033", "create_time": 1787053297, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "开头看到蜈蚣从嘴里爬出来 我的表情belike", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "7510", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAZ6EkDG_jH4ruH4GB-JFx49k7Llk3EL1VgbBBMqxqzrs", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAZ6EkDG_jH4ruH4GB-JFx49k7Llk3EL1VgbBBMqxqzrs", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "O_oK...", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "无语（见过鹿晗✌🏻次版）", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_e5755fa2d01e76bb4308c9a3063e0a4d.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "20", "last_modify_ts": 1794419513596}, {"comment_id": "7675718943663063845", "create_time": 1787142583, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7675276073055178011", "content": "南方山林湿热，毒虫、毒菌、有毒植物繁多。古人分不清食物中毒、慢性重金属中毒、寄生虫病、真菌感染。人慢慢身体变差、消瘦、失眠、皮肤青紫、精神恍惚，查不出当时的医学病因，就会归因为“被人下蛊”。很多所谓“蛊毒症状”，就是重金属慢性中毒、肝损伤、寄生虫带来的躯体反应。情蛊，几乎全部是心理与情绪的产物。古代相思、失恋、爱而不得，人会出现失眠、吃不下饭、情绪低落、郁郁成疾。没有病菌虫子伤害身体，是巨大的思念、执念、悲伤，长期压抑，引发躯体化反应。古人无法解释心理会让身体难受，就创造出“情蛊”这个概念：把人的执念，具象化成一只虫子。世界上不存在可以操控人心的蛊虫。古时候人们不懂寄生虫、慢性中毒也不懂心理情绪可以影响人的身体健康。身体莫名病痛，爱而不得相思成疾，就幻化出了“蛊”的传说。所谓情蛊，本质是古人把爱恨执念具象化出来的故事蛊不在山林，不在罐子里，而是藏在人的情绪与思念之中相信科学博主南翔也解说了 我觉得大家可以看这个，这个是在一个苗寨视频里头所复制的[比心]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "386", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAzvr9vTqusNxlggeSp8GmUc3w2ckTZCbqQNzlGBi5yo5UtE9vUKFDWIXsfrR5l3Gs", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAzvr9vTqusNxlggeSp8GmUc3w2ckTZCbqQNzlGBi5yo5UtE9vUK